     2	 * Import/export of the standard Netscape bookmark HTML format (SCN-021).
     3	 * Import preserves title, labels (folder path + TAGS, de-duplicated case-insensitively),
     4	 * and the added date. Export writes the whole collection preserving titles, labels, dates.
